{"version":1,"herramienta":"whisperx medium + wav2vec2 es (letras)","audio":"celulas-luteinicas.m4a","duracion":31.679,"texto":"Las células luteinicas son las células secretoras del cuerpo lúteo y se originan a partir de las células de la granulosa y de la teca interna tras la ovulación. Las células luteinicas de la granulosa son grandes y poseen un citoplasma pálido rico en lípidos, mientras que las células luteinicas de la teca son más pequeñas y se tiñen más intensamente. Si ocurre fecundación e implantación, la HCG mantiene activo el cuerpo lúteo durante las primeras etapas del embarazo. de la policía.","cues":[[0.0,"X"],[1.05,"B"],[1.21,"C"],[1.27,"H"],[1.33,"F"],[1.41,"D"],[1.49,"B"],[1.67,"F"],[1.83,"B"],[1.89,"C"],[2.07,"B"],[2.13,"C"],[2.25,"B"],[2.31,"D"],[2.39,"B"],[2.65,"E"],[2.71,"B"],[2.79,"D"],[2.85,"B"],[2.951,"H"],[3.051,"F"],[3.131,"D"],[3.191,"B"],[3.311,"C"],[3.391,"B"],[3.471,"C"],[3.591,"B"],[3.911,"C"],[3.971,"H"],[4.091,"F"],[4.151,"B"],[4.391,"A"],[4.451,"E"],[4.551,"H"],[4.611,"F"],[4.731,"C"],[4.831,"E"],[4.891,"C"],[4.951,"X"],[5.411,"C"],[5.551,"B"],[5.631,"C"],[5.831,"B"],[5.891,"D"],[5.991,"B"],[6.071,"D"],[6.251,"B"],[6.531,"C"],[6.651,"D"],[6.711,"B"],[6.871,"F"],[6.991,"D"],[7.051,"B"],[7.171,"C"],[7.252,"D"],[7.372,"B"],[7.472,"D"],[7.532,"B"],[7.612,"F"],[7.692,"H"],[7.752,"E"],[7.832,"B"],[7.892,"D"],[7.972,"C"],[8.032,"X"],[8.212,"C"],[8.312,"D"],[8.472,"B"],[8.532,"C"],[8.612,"B"],[8.672,"D"],[8.752,"C"],[8.812,"B"],[9.112,"D"],[9.332,"B"],[9.432,"D"],[9.492,"B"],[9.572,"D"],[9.692,"A"],[9.772,"F"],[9.852,"H"],[9.912,"D"],[10.032,"C"],[10.112,"B"],[10.232,"X"],[10.972,"B"],[11.132,"C"],[11.192,"H"],[11.252,"F"],[11.312,"D"],[11.372,"B"],[11.472,"F"],[11.613,"B"],[11.673,"C"],[11.953,"D"],[12.033,"B"],[12.153,"C"],[12.233,"D"],[12.333,"B"],[12.413,"D"],[12.473,"B"],[12.533,"F"],[12.613,"H"],[12.673,"E"],[12.733,"B"],[12.793,"D"],[12.933,"B"],[13.013,"E"],[13.073,"B"],[13.273,"D"],[13.333,"B"],[13.533,"C"],[13.593,"X"],[14.053,"A